%H A098792 Amiram Eldar, <a href="/A098792/b098792.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..1000</a>
%t A098792 f[n_] := Plus @@ Binomial[n, Select[Range[n], GCD[n, # ] == 1 &]]; Table[ f[n]/n, {n, 38}] (* _Robert G. Wilson v_, Nov 04 2004 *)
%o A098792 (PARI) a(n) = if(n == 1, 1, sum(k=0, n, if(gcd(n, k) == 1, binomial(n, k)))/n); \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Oct 06 2026
